{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0d42c31feb047b48b083c98a622e68b78b577b3ff34b2d92f2b91b12595aa9fa",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c235110ed9d9b0875710dde84948f5bc6f40bab015210f4294a8ab935ef2121",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n关于下次的拍摄，能找你商量商量吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000009:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43d3c6fba2a390611692f44454ed61c5a94943c96d930f78af693e4101b1ce86",
      "text": "好啊，有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3ad8c5aa278f6cc3a3aa323259470a1582de7c4ea932d2d41c43283143bb001",
      "text": "之前不是说我要演个类似公司社长的感觉，\n戴着眼镜帅气地去拍摄嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:376489d8fd63c07742cd685b8f4500e900be03c04b534d94f8f2b3387d4ad649",
      "text": "我说想试戴看看，\n玄武就把他闲置的眼镜借给我了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd86f009a6ed26ea143b5ecd81d4f73c1ac373e3d27d9fbb113dfa9302bcf5e7",
      "text": "那个设计，\n超级合拍的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b9238d9ee3433684af79a06ff6550d175921b4655ef4957199735d8c4fa164c",
      "text": "可以的话，我想戴类似的眼镜去拍摄，\n但又觉得不能擅自做主，所以就联系你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47058c137151bb73ae2e96b7a01db2022622683f9d9bf0523fc64ef82be09306",
      "text": "我觉得应该没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9999fbd9f08b7500630cd12ed494839a25268af04e42e92c88728cb6e2762d32",
      "text": "我会去和对方\n商量好的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1998fc1e6c5c82258d30d4c71af163887e81f67efe6d510a540d2071593b7dd",
      "text": "哦哦！谢啦，制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0091e9f3ce3d5e25f845a1486b2d8bf68cc28fee5aad287b703169159d94d886",
      "text": "嘿嘿，这样一来就能离所谓的干练大人\n更近一步啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec535a300923339a79a8f9dfb501261db5c97c1e27b06ca2afc674884574dd14",
      "text": "上班族到底是个什么感觉，\n虽然我目前还不太懂，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0573a9da47fd752c90f1e1b01b25b61c14c82a7488c96bfe881702a71c7cbbed",
      "text": "但我一定要让看到海报的人，\n对工作都能充满干劲！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_403_2_4_025_03_09_b:2_4_025_03_09_b:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:604b9791ae478ed6bed32d685a4a5ed5fb286fd83535c86fde45b927b1d9e1bc",
      "text": "那么，要是再有什么事我再找你商量！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
